; Taken, not freed: the dark wizard himself, the Throne's boss, earned by beating him there on Hardcore
; (.ai/dark-wizard-playable.md; the "the_taker_taken" deed). Never named on screen - "the Dark Wizard" is
; what he is, as the boss bar says (BossCatalog) - and never shown, not even as a silhouette, until he is
; taken (UnlockDefinition.SealedUntilFreed). Outside the campaign gate: he is not one of the imprisoned.
;
; He opens on The Taking, his own: the boss's hand, his light and all he took, turned on the horde. His
; passive is Dread: his Darkness hits frighten twice as often - the horde is his making, and knows him.
; Carried by his shadow rather than quick on his feet.
